PACKAGE NAME:     xf_kit
PACKAGE SIZE:     834 K
PACKAGE LOCATION: diskxd1
PACKAGE DESCRIPTION:
xf_kit:   XFree86 2.1.1 Linkkit
xf_kit: 
xf_kit:   If you want or need to rebuild an XFree86 2.1.1 server you need this
xf_kit:   package in addition to the base configuration and the programmers kit.
xf_kit:   It is not needed for other X program development.
xf_kit:
xf_kit:   When rebuilding all the servers (including PEX) you will typically
xf_kit:   need an additional 10MB of disk space.  If you are building just a
xf_kit:   single server you will need 2MB (2.5MB with PEX) of space.
xf_kit: 
